{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2760c86f75b8288125fb6a8fa3ac9ebd32e4daf5ff16f15d6a0db354ec8d953b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8a3e5f3a213593608b9478d6125009b6f411a09c0acf83dfea6940715dcefc7",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n差不多到出发的时间了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:492623c042f1b3a2937801eff55a1c932f0daf6aec091c1d69541e06562459be",
      "text": "我很想买的那款蛋糕也顺利买到了，\n现在就回你那边去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236787cd74a75c71062031dd4097c2b4b306b8859b086890b39c5d6619e47c5b",
      "text": "那是以富士山为主题的当地限定蛋糕，\n造型也超级可爱哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e10254abadd843587db5b248f37f17dbe1a3184e6e0d1ee0c7b6d169bf6997c",
      "text": "难得来这里一趟，想着一定要去平时去不了的店\n逛逛，所以就提前查好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef0005ebb5201c6958a5f0f27fb6ce27c241a08ef891ad92153677cf08bcf14d",
      "text": "制作人如果不介意的话，\n要不要也一起尝尝？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ccdb247ca887c1f4279c535933ad9b6b5a8b10a7a92d1c133ba0546c376d51",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d17ebab10c7c78e374f77e97da5c5c8e0cc173fe83857af2cb8d0234c511ab14",
      "text": "我很想尝尝",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ce515c39d13c1eda6e43d4d990e7861455f778f41f7b3b7e0907a98f68d3990",
      "text": "好！回去之后也给制作人一份当慰劳品！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f55c324d538915c57c43b4fa9791a3b17256398ed6c92500679b584d5c240e34",
      "text": "这款蛋糕不仅外观讲究，\n味道也是公认的绝品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef4c0720117da8878b9a8f3431d1e66ca62e87efe7c901e6e5655f9f6a572b7",
      "text": "虽然今天一大早就开始拍摄很辛苦，\n但托大家的福拍到了很棒的照片，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72706e05e0a0cd573d9675bac5b983feefa54b21b61679be2e250a76b67d5f43",
      "text": "而且还买到了看起来就很好吃的蛋糕，\n真是太幸福了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_402_2_4_030_02_09_b:2_4_030_02_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ffad61d805b6e351aaa051111305d3353410fbf100c7393003cc5ea437c1be",
      "text": "呵呵，好期待会是什么味道呀。\n那么，待会儿见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
